Feature: Receive goods
  Warehouse staff and the purchasing system add received goods to the on-hand stock. The shell loads
  the stored level of each SKU-location pair of the lines.

  Scenario Outline: Received goods add to the on-hand count of each line
    When I run "receive_goods" with:
      | caller.role | now                      | idempotency_key | purchase_order_id | receipt_lines                                                                                                                 | stored_levels                                                                                                                                                                                     |
      | <role>      | 2026-11-22T10:00:00.000Z | receive-0001    | PO-1001           | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "quantity": 20}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "quantity": 5}] | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 500, "reserved": 100, "available": 400}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "on_hand": 50, "reserved": 40, "available": 10}] |
    Then the output is "receipt":
      | purchase_order_id | levels                                                                                                                                                                                            |
      | PO-1001           | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 520, "reserved": 100, "available": 420}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "on_hand": 55, "reserved": 40, "available": 15}] |

    Examples:
      | role              |
      | warehouse_staff   |
      | purchasing_system |

  Scenario: A line received two times adds both quantities
    When I run "receive_goods" with:
      | caller.role     | now                      | idempotency_key | purchase_order_id | receipt_lines                                                                                                                  | stored_levels                                                                                      |
      | warehouse_staff | 2026-11-22T10:00:00.000Z | receive-0001    | PO-1001           | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "quantity": 20}, {"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "quantity": 30}] | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 500, "reserved": 100, "available": 400}] |
    Then the output is "receipt":
      | levels                                                                                                                                                                                               |
      | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 520, "reserved": 100, "available": 420}, {"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 550, "reserved": 100, "available": 450}] |

  Scenario Outline: Another caller may not receive goods
    When I run "receive_goods" with:
      | caller.role | now                      | idempotency_key | purchase_order_id | receipt_lines                                                                                                                 | stored_levels                                                                                                                                                                                     |
      | <role>      | 2026-11-22T10:00:00.000Z | receive-0001    | PO-1001           | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "quantity": 20}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "quantity": 5}] | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 500, "reserved": 100, "available": 400}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "on_hand": 50, "reserved": 40, "available": 10}] |
    Then the output is "forbidden":
      | error_code | role   |
      | FORBIDDEN  | <role> |

    Examples:
      | role                 |
      | order_system         |
      | warehouse_supervisor |
      | clock                |

  Scenario: A line of an unknown SKU is refused
    When I run "receive_goods" with:
      | caller.role     | now                      | idempotency_key | purchase_order_id | receipt_lines                                                                                                                    | stored_levels                                                                                                                                                                                     |
      | warehouse_staff | 2026-11-22T10:00:00.000Z | receive-0001    | PO-1001           | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "quantity": 20}, {"sku": "NO-SUCH-SKU", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "quantity": 5}] | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 500, "reserved": 100, "available": 400}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "on_hand": 50, "reserved": 40, "available": 10}] |
    Then the output is "unknown_sku":
      | error_code  | sku         |
      | UNKNOWN_SKU | NO-SUCH-SKU |

  Scenario: A line at an unknown location is refused
    When I run "receive_goods" with:
      | caller.role     | now                      | idempotency_key | purchase_order_id | receipt_lines                                                  | stored_levels                                                                                                                                                                                     |
      | warehouse_staff | 2026-11-22T10:00:00.000Z | receive-0001    | PO-1001           | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "ZZZ-Z-9999", "quantity": 5}] | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 500, "reserved": 100, "available": 400}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "on_hand": 50, "reserved": 40, "available": 10}] |
    Then the output is "unknown_location":
      | error_code       | location   |
      | UNKNOWN_LOCATION | ZZZ-Z-9999 |

  Scenario Outline: A receipt that breaks a rule is rejected
    When I run "receive_goods" with:
      | caller.role     | now                      | idempotency_key | purchase_order_id   | receipt_lines   | stored_levels   |
      | warehouse_staff | 2026-11-22T10:00:00.000Z | receive-0001    | <purchase_order_id> | <receipt_lines> | <stored_levels> |
    Then the input is rejected by "<rule>" of "<definition>"

